<view class="page"><view class="title">你只管说事，鸭鸭组团办事！</view><view class="hint">情绪有出口，证据有出处，售后有后手。</view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card" a:if="{{capabilities}}">AI：{{capabilities.aiConfigured?'已配置，真实请求由服务端处理':'未配置，可体验明确标记的示例案件'}}</view><button onTap="create">开始处理一件售后</button><button onTap="demo" loading="{{loading}}">体验耳机退款示例</button><view class="row"><button a:for="{{ducks}}" key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" onTap="duck"><image class="duck" src="/assets/{{item.id}}.png"/>{{item.name}}</button></view><view class="hint">小程序适配工程。需开发者工具、合法域名和平台审核验证。</view></view>
